  "body": "Submitted by @&#8203;matthew:matrix.org\nWhen matrix.org's VM fell over the other day, lots of people asked what backup server we can connect to. In practice I think they just want an alternative public server they can create an account on and use - obviously we don't have decentralised accounts or HA between synapses yet. We advertise oddvar.org on the wiki page, but I'm not sure it's being maintained - we could perhaps have an official backup.matrix.org HS or something for this purpose\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-478)",
